{"id":"had-better-ought-to","lv":"b1","n":12,"cat":"modals","t":"Had better, ought to, be supposed to: khuyên và điều lẽ ra phải làm","en":"You'd better… · ought to · be supposed to","sum":"Had better ('d better) + nguyên thể = tốt hơn hết là…, kẻo có chuyện: You'd better hurry. Mạnh hơn should, dùng cho tình huống cụ thể, gấp; phủ định had better not. Ought to ≈ should (hơi trang trọng, ít dùng trong câu hỏi, phủ định). Be supposed to = theo quy định, kế hoạch, sự mong đợi thì phải: We're supposed to be there at nine. You're not supposed to eat here. Quá khứ was supposed to = lẽ ra phải (nhưng đã không).","forms":[{"f":"had better ('d better) + nguyên thể","vi":"You'd better hurry."},{"f":"had better not + nguyên thể","vi":"You'd better not be late."},{"f":"ought to = should","vi":"You ought to see a doctor."},{"f":"be supposed to = theo quy định, kế hoạch","vi":"We're supposed to be there at nine."}],"pts":[{"id":"had-better","name":"had better","vi":"You'd better…: lời khuyên kèm cảnh báo"},{"id":"ought-to","name":"ought to","vi":"Ought to ≈ should (trang trọng hơn một chút)"},{"id":"be-supposed-to","name":"be supposed to","vi":"Be supposed to: theo quy định / kế hoạch thì phải, lẽ ra"}],"cast":{"ana":{"name":{"en":"Ana","vi":"Ana"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#8C3B4A","topShade":"#76303D","accent":"#A23B55","hair":"curly","hairColor":"#2B1D18","skin":"#8D5A3C","skinShade":"#784A30"},"x":560},"linh":{"name":{"en":"Linh","vi":"Linh"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"blouse","top":"#9A6FC4","topShade":"#8159AA","accent":"#8159AA","hair":"bob","hairColor":"#1C1716","skin":"#F2CFAE","skinShade":"#E0B592"},"x":1040}},"bg":"office","props":[{"id":"report","x":820}],"beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Linh, it's 8:45! You'd better hurry.","vi":"Chị Linh, 8 giờ 45 rồi! Chị nhanh lên kẻo muộn.","ipa":["lɪn","ɪts","","jud","ˈbɛtɚ","ˈhɝi"],"who":"ana","ann":{"expression":"worried"},"b":1,"start":0.454,"end":3.414,"timing":[[0,0.454],[1,0.66],[2,0.92],